  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-disability</b></p><a name=\"ahip-disability\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-disability\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-disability-codes</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>COMM</td><td>Communicating or being understood using your usual language</td></tr><tr><td>CONC</td><td>Concentrating, remembering, or making decisions</td></tr><tr><td>COOK</td><td>Cooking for oneself</td></tr><tr><td>DRES</td><td>Dressing or bathing</td></tr><tr><td>ERRA</td><td>Doing errands alone</td></tr><tr><td>FEED</td><td>Feeding oneself</td></tr><tr><td>HEAR</td><td>Hearing</td></tr><tr><td>SEEI</td><td>Seeing (even when wearing glasses)</td></tr><tr><td>UNDE</td><td>Understanding when someone speaks in your usual language</td></tr><tr><td>TOIL</td><td>Using the toilet</td></tr><tr><td>WALK</td><td>Walking or climbing stairs</td></tr><tr><td>NONE</td><td>None</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Other difficulties when doing activities throughout your day (please describe)</td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
